mber</loc>\n    <priority>0.8</priority>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/residence/abyss-pool-suite</loc>\n    <priority>0.8</priority>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/residence/presidential-sanctuary</loc>\n    <priority>0.9</priority>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/experiences</loc>\n    <priority>0.9</priority>\n    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/architecture</loc>\n    <priority>0.85</priority>\n    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/gallery</loc>\n    <priority>0.8</priority>\n    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/reservations</loc>\n    <priority>0.95</priority>\n    <changefreq>daily</changefreq>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/contact</loc>\n    <priority>0.7</priority>\n    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/privacy-policy</loc>\n    <priority>0.3</priority>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://noctra-hotel.com/terms-and-conditions</loc>\n    <priority>0.3</priority>\n  </url>\n</urlset>\n"},{"path":"README.md","content":"# NOCTRA — Premium Subterranean Luxury Hotel\n### Escape the Surface · Western Ghats, Maharashtra, India\n\nNOCTRA is an ultra-luxury subterranean sanctuary carved deep within the 66-million-year-old monolithic Deccan volcanic basalt of Mount Sahyadri, Western Ghats, Maharashtra, India. It combines futuristic brutalist architecture, natural stone formations, subterranean thermal mineral springs, private luxury suites, and silent sanctuaries.\n\n---\n\n## 🏛️ Brand Concept & Architectural Pillars\n- **Zero Surface Visibility**: Concealed subterranean funicular descent into the mountain core.\n- **Deccan Basalt Integration**: 85% preserved authentic monolithic basalt faces.\n- **Circadian Lighting**: Fiber-optic spectrum synchronized with human circadian and melatonin cycles.\n- **Passive Geothermal Thermodynamics**: 17.5°C constant natural bedrock temperature.\n- **Vedic Silence (Mauna)**: Acoustic isolation rated at 55dB with an anechoic chamber at -2.5dB.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 The 5 Subterranean Residences\n1. **The Obsidian Suite** (185 m² · Depth -180m · ₹1,65,000 / Night)\n2. **The Aurelia Chamber** (215 m² · Depth -210m · ₹2,10,000 / Night)\n3. **The Cavern Residence** (260 m² · Depth -240m · ₹2,40,000 / Night)\n4. **The Abyss Pool Suite** (340 m² · Depth -310m · ₹3,20,000 / Night)\n5. **The Presidential Sanctuary** (520 m² · Depth -380m · ₹5,50,000 / Night)\n\n---\n\n## 🌊 Subterranean Rites & Experiences\n- **The Underground Spa & Snana Sanctuary**: Four geothermal pools, Himalayan pink salt cavern, Ayurvedic botanical rituals.\n- **Private Dining at Cripta**: Two Michelin-starred subterranean Indian gastronomy, 9-course degustation, 14,000-bottle cellar.\n- **The Abyss Thermal Pool**: 40-meter black Deccan basalt infinity pool with fiber-optic constellations.\n- **The Geological Expedition**: Guided exploration of untouched Deccan volcanic caves and crystal geodes.\n- **The Silent Sanctuary (Mauna Pavilion)**: Sensory deprivation and acoustic stillness.\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Technology Stack\n- **Framework**: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4\n- **Routing**: React Router DOM (v7) with route-level code splitting (`React.lazy`)\n- **Animations**: Framer Motion\n- **Icons**: Lucide React\n- **Design Tokens**: Obsidian Black (`#10100F`), Deep Charcoal (`#191918`), Graphite (`#292825`), Champagne (`#C5AE8B`), Warm Ivory (`#EAE4D9`)\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Local Development\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# Start development server\nnpm run dev\n\n# Build for production\nnpm run build\n\n# Preview production build\nnpm run preview\n```\n\n© 2026 NOCTRA SANCTUARY HOSPITALITY PVT. LTD. All rights reserved.\n"},{"path":"src/App.css","content":".counter {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 5px 10px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  background: var(--accent-bg);\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  transition: border-color 0.3s;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n\n  &:hover {\n    border-color: var(--accent-border);\n  }\n  &:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n}\n\n.hero {\n  position: relative;\n\n  .base,\n  .framework,\n  .vite {\n    inset-inline: 0;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .base {\n    width: 170px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n\n  .framework,\n  .vite {\n    position: absolute;\n  }\n\n  .framework {\n    z-index: 1;\n    top: 34px;\n    height: 28px;\n    transform: perspective(2000px) rotateZ(300deg) rotateX(44deg) rotateY(39deg)\n      scale(1.4);\n  }\n\n  .vite {\n    z-index: 0;\n    top: 107px;\n    height: 26px;\n    width: auto;\n    transform: perspective(2000px) rotateZ(300deg) rotateX(40deg) rotateY(39deg)\n      scale(0.8);\n  }\n}\n\n#center {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 25px;\n  place-content: center;\n  place-items: center;\n  flex-grow: 1;\n\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    padding: 32px 20px 24px;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n}\n\n#next-steps {\n  display: flex;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  text-align: left;\n\n  & > div {\n    flex: 1 1 0;\n    padding: 32px;\n    @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n      padding: 24px 20px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .icon {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n}\n\n#docs {\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    border-right: none;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n}\n\n#next-steps ul {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin: 32px 0 0;\n\n  .logo {\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n\n  a {\n    color: var(--text-h);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: var(--social-bg);\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: box-shadow 0.3s;\n\n    &:hover {\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    }\n    .button-icon {\n      height: 18px;\n      width: 18px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: center;\n\n    li {\n      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 8px);\n    }\n\n    a {\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n#spacer {\n  height: 88px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    height: 48px;\n  }\n}\n\n.ticks {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n\n  &::before,\n  &::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -4.5px;\n    border: 5px solid transparent;\n  }\n\n  &::before {\n    left: 0;\n    border-left-color: var(--border);\n  }\n  &::after {\n    right: 0;\n    border-right-color: var(--border);\n  }\n}\n"},{"path":"src/App.tsx","content":"import React, { Suspense, lazy } from 'react';\nimport { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route, useLocation } from 'react-router-dom';\nimport { AnimatePresence } from 'framer-motion';\n\n// Global Components\nimport { Navbar } from './components/Navbar/Navbar';\nimport { Footer } from './components/Footer/Footer';\nimport { Preloader } from './components/Preloader/Preloader';\nimport { CustomCursor } from './components/CustomCursor/CustomCursor';\nimport { ScrollToTop } from './components/ScrollToTop';\nimport { PageTransition } from './components/PageTransition/PageTransition';\n\n// Lazy Loaded Pages for Optimal Performance\nconst Home = lazy(() => import('./pages/Home/Home').then(m => ({ default: m.Home })));\nconst Residence = lazy(() => import('./pages/Residence/Residence').then(m => ({ default: m.Residence })));\nconst SuiteDetail = lazy(() => import('./pages/Residence/SuiteDetail').then(m => ({ default: m.SuiteDetail })));\nconst Experiences = lazy(() => import('./pages/Experiences/Experiences').then(m => ({ default: m.Experiences })));\nconst Architecture = lazy(() => import('./pages/Architecture/Architecture').then(m => ({ default: m.Architecture })));\nconst Gallery = lazy(() => import('./pages/Gallery/Gallery').then(m => ({ default: m.Gallery })));\nconst Reservations = lazy(() => import('./pages/Reservations/Reservations').then(m => ({ default: m.Reservations })));\nconst Contact = lazy(() => import('./pages/Contact/Contact').then(m => ({ default: m.Contact })));\nconst PrivacyPolicy = lazy(() => import('./pages/Legal/PrivacyPolicy').then(m => ({ default: m.PrivacyPolicy })));\nconst Terms = lazy(() => import('./pages/Legal/Terms').then(m => ({ default: m.Terms })));\nconst NotFound = lazy(() => import('./pages/NotFound').then(m => ({ default: m.NotFound })));\n\nconst FallbackLoader: React.FC = () => (\n  <div className=\"w-full min-h-screen bg-[#10100F] flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n      <div className=\"w-8 h-8 border border-[#292825] border-t-[#C5AE8B] rounded-full animate-spin\" />\n      <span className=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-[#77736A]\">\n        Decrypting Subterranean Sector...\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n);\n\nconst AnimatedRoutes: React.FC = () => {\n  const location = useLocation();\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\">\n      <Suspense fallback={<FallbackLoader />}>\n        <Routes location={location} key={location.pathname}>\n          <Route\n            path=\"/\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Home />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/residence\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Residence />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/residence/:id\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <SuiteDetail />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/experiences\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Experiences />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/architecture\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Architecture />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/gallery\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Gallery />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/reservations\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Reservations />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/contact\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Contact />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/privacy-policy\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <PrivacyPolicy />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"/terms-and-conditions\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <Terms />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n          <Route\n            path=\"*\"\n            element={\n              <PageTransition>\n                <NotFound />\n              </PageTransition>\n            }\n          />\n        </Routes>\n      </Suspense>\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n};\n\nexport const App: React.FC = () => {\n  return (\n    <Router>\n      <div className=\"relative min-h-screen bg-[#10100F] text-[#EAE4D9] select